  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">WBG Pub Sec Fin Mgmt Ref Struc Adj Oper</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The PA has implemented a Public Financial Management Reform Program with two principal objectives.  The first is to further improve its financial management systems within a broader national reform agenda.  The second is to provide budgetary and fiduciary assurances to donors sufficient to ensure their financial support during the 2004 and 2005 budget years.  The Bank&apos;s Adjustment Operation was intended to: (1) provide budgetary support for the PA in a time of acute economic and fiscal crisis; (2) help leverage additional donor support for the Reform Trust Fund among other donors; and (3) help provide additional support for the PA&apos;s financial management reform agenda.  This Adjustment Operation was processed in parallel with the Reform Fundcomma and the agreed upon program of policy reformscomma the matrix and the Letter of Development Policy (LDP) were the same.</narrative>
  </description>
